I tip my hat.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.964
So, anyways, we're going to have
"A Closer Look"

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.632
for you tomorrow,
but we wanted to do more

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.035
of our other
favorite things on the show.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.238
And here's the premise,
you guys --

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:16.675
We do a lot of jokes on our show
that due to having a diverse

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:19.078
writing staff,
some of them don't sound

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:23.115
right coming from me,
a straight white man.

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:26.252
We decided that we should still
tell you some of those jokes,

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.987
which brings us to a segment
we call,

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.989
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.225 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:38.131
Hey, everybody.
These are two of our writers.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:41.167
-I'm black.
-And I'm gay.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.237
-And we're both women.
-And I'm not.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:45.471
So here's how it works.

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.506
I'm gonna read the setups
to these jokes,

00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:50.343
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.377
All right, everybody.
Are you ready?

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.546
Here we go.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:57.383
First setup, the footwear
company Crocs

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.486
is working
with the makers of marshmallow

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:03.890
Peeps to release clogs
in pastel colors.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.959
-Said lesbians,
"You had me at clogs,

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.895
but you lost me at pastel."

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:12.298
-There you go.
That's how this works.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:16.035
Moving on,
the Smithsonian Channel

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.804
recently released a documentary
called,

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:22.474
"Black in Space" about
the first black astronaut.

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:24.844
-Said the astronaut, "I did it.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:28.114
I finally got away
from all these white people."

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:31.216
Hey, Seth, you know,
a black astronaut

00:02:31.216 --> 00:02:36.456
is just like a white astronaut,
except his boots are spotless.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:40.026
-All right.
I will take your word for it.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:43.262
Moving on,
the cosmetics chain Sephora

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:45.598
will open 100 new stores.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.235
-"That's where I buy my makeup,"
said lesbians about Walgreens.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.404
-All right.

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:53.906
And that's good news
for lesbians,

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:58.077
'cause Walgreens is probably
still open during the pandemic.

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:59.945
-Probably one of the few places.

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:04.483
-Hey, Jenny, what does it look
like when lesbians wear makeup?

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:09.254
-Looks kind of like this.
-Oh, are you pointing at me?

00:03:09.254 --> 00:03:11.624
-No. No.
-It looks like this.

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.993
-All right. All right.
I'm moving on now.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.427
So far in the Democratic
primary,

00:03:15.427 --> 00:03:16.695
former Vice President Joe Biden

00:03:16.695 --> 00:03:20.032
has won 86% of
the African-American vote.

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:22.935
-That's right. Black people
have given Joe Biden

00:03:22.935 --> 00:03:27.407
a resounding [sigh]

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:28.941
Okay.

00:03:28.941 --> 00:03:32.044
-Hey, Amber, how are you gonna
vote on election day?

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:34.080
-The same way all
black people vote --

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.748
I'm gonna call in sick,

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.850
drive 50 miles
to my nearest polling place,

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.319
have a lady tell me my name
is not on the list,

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:43.423
insist that it is, show her
my voter registration card,

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:46.058
shut her up,
stand in line for seven hours,

00:03:46.058 --> 00:03:48.060
and then vote for someone
who may or may not

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.362
keep their promises
to black people.

00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:52.632
That's democracy!

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:54.867
-That was beautiful, Amber.
That was really beautiful.

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:56.702
-Thank you. So am I.

00:03:56.702 --> 00:03:58.971
-An animal rescue group
in South Carolina

00:03:58.971 --> 00:04:02.575
is seeking volunteers
to cuddle with 100 pigs.

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.444
-"I love cuddling with pigs,"
said straight women.

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:08.647
-[ Gasps ] Jenny!
How dare you!

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:11.451
My husband is a pig!
-[ Chuckles ]

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:14.286
-He's one of the good ones.

00:04:14.286 --> 00:04:17.323
-Hey, um, let's let people
behind the scenes for a minute

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.392
for "Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:21.494
Do you guys want to explain
what we call it

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:26.966
when there is a volley
of dialogue after the jokes?

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.034
-Amber,
I think you should say it.

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:31.637
-You think?
Well, we have the regular jokes,

00:04:31.637 --> 00:04:33.138
and then anything
we say in between,

00:04:33.138 --> 00:04:35.708
we call them
the black and forths.

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:39.746
-The black and forths.
The black and forths.

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:42.381
-All right, let's move
on to another joke.

00:04:42.381 --> 00:04:46.519
The Oscar Mayer Wienermobile was
pulled over by police recently.

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:49.455
-They figured a wiener
that big had to be black.

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:50.823
-Amber!

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:53.091
-You know what the police said
when they saw him?

00:04:53.091 --> 00:04:55.161
Look out, he's got a bun!

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:59.264
-Okay, that one, that was
the dumbest part of this.

00:04:59.264 --> 00:05:02.835
Hey, a right-wing radio host
last week blamed gay people

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:05.638
for San Francisco's
coronavirus shutdown.

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.774
-Officials are calling it
not the worst thing

00:05:07.774 --> 00:05:09.409
gay people have been blamed for.

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:11.543
-Yep. That one's very true.

00:05:11.543 --> 00:05:13.045
According to a new report,
more Americans

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:15.280
are watching
the adult website PornHub

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.783
as they practice
social distancing.

00:05:17.783 --> 00:05:21.453
-So, please, wash your hands.

00:05:21.453 --> 00:05:23.856
-[ Chuckles ]

00:05:23.856 --> 00:05:26.025
Gwyneth Paltrow's website
is selling a candle

00:05:26.025 --> 00:05:28.594
that she claims smells
like her vagina.

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:32.865
-Said a lesbian coming home
to her wife,

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:35.368
[ Sniffing ]
"Are you cheating on me?"

00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:37.236
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:38.704
I do want to note
that some of these

00:05:38.704 --> 00:05:41.440
are playing exactly as well
as they would with an audience.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.243
[ Laughter ]

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:46.212
-Oh, here's one.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.247
Everybody's gonna like this one.
-Oh, yeah.

00:05:48.247 --> 00:05:51.183
-Supreme Court Justice
Brett Kavanaugh

00:05:51.183 --> 00:05:54.821
has made the court's cafeteria
add pizza to the menu,

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:57.290
which has been described
as "just below Pizza Hut,

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.659
and just above the average
gas station offering."

00:06:00.659 --> 00:06:03.863
-Well, you know what they say --
pizza is like sex.

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.564
Even when it's bad,
Brett Kavanaugh

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:07.867
will still try
to force it on you.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:11.371
-[ Chuckles ]

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:13.572
-Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:06:13.572 --> 00:06:15.374
-Oh, I don't know, guys.

00:06:15.374 --> 00:06:17.009
-Come on, Seth, just one.

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:19.478
-I feel like it's not
gonna end well.

00:06:19.478 --> 00:06:21.847
-Do it! Do it!
-Okay, okay, I trust you guys.

00:06:21.847 --> 00:06:24.884
You wouldn't lie to me
during a pandemic.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:26.485
The Cheesecake Factory
is coming out

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:29.087
with a new ice cream flavor
made with their cheesecake.

00:06:29.087 --> 00:06:32.124
So if you want cheesecake
and you want ice cream,

00:06:32.124 --> 00:06:34.226
you're probably on your period.

00:06:34.226 --> 00:06:38.331
-[ Gasps ] Seth!
-[ Whimpering ]

00:06:38.331 --> 00:06:40.299
I'll do another one.
-Okay.

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:42.435
-A man in Massachusetts
was arrested after meeting

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:44.870
a woman on a dating app

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.073
and then forcing her
to drive the getaway car

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:49.575
after he robbed a bank
on their first date.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:54.012
But she's over 30, so she's
gonna try to make it work.

00:06:54.012 --> 00:06:56.616
-How dare you?!

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:59.084
-You both told me that
it would be okay!

00:06:59.084 --> 00:07:00.920
-You should be
ashamed of yourself.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.488
-I am not ashamed of myself,

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:04.690
but I tell you one thing
that I know to be true --

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.926
Black women
and lesbians are liars!

00:07:06.926 --> 00:07:10.496
♪♪

00:07:10.496 --> 00:07:14.366
Hey, guys, give it up
for Amber and Jenny.

00:07:14.366 --> 00:07:15.901
Give it up for all of our staff

00:07:15.901 --> 00:07:17.603
who are making this all work
remotely.

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.371
And thank you so much
for being patient with us

00:07:19.371 --> 00:07:22.240
as we work out the kinks.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:26.312
And, yeah,
we will see you tomorrow

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:28.548
with another "A Closer Look."
Thank you all for watching.

